# =============================================================================
# EXPENSEFLOW — SUPABASE CLOUD SYNCHRONIZATION CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================
#
# 1. Sign up or log in at https://supabase.com
# 2. Create a new project (e.g., "ExpenseFlow")
# 3. Navigate to Project Settings -> API
# 4. Copy your Project URL and anon/public key into this file or your deployment settings:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

# NOTE: Never expose your service_role secret key in frontend code!
# The anon key is safe for client-side use when Row Level Security (RLS) is enabled.

